Classic queue (single node): node down -> queue unavailable until it recovers

Quorum queue (Raft-replicated across nodes):
  declare arguments: { "x-queue-type": "quorum" }
  // survives a minority of node failures, at the cost of write latency for quorum acknowledgment

Publisher confirm: publisher -> broker
  channel.ConfirmSelect();
  channel.BasicPublish(...);
  channel.WaitForConfirms(); // broker acks once the message is actually persisted

Consumer ack: broker -> consumer
  channel.BasicConsume(queue, autoAck: false, consumer);
  // ... process message fully ...
  channel.BasicAck(deliveryTag, multiple: false); // only after processing succeeds

// A confirmed publish with no manual consumer ack can still lose work if the consumer crashes mid-process

